Cline CLI screens in this folder are plain-text (no colour) for harnesses/cline.toml.

Every *-src.txt file here is CONSTRUCTED, not a capture. Each is built from short UI strings in
Cline CLI 3.0.74 (npm package `cline` 3.0.74, sha256
4daea6d75508760b18447d6f00c6bac88ef20af8fe17da4252a90a20fe36c692; its darwin-arm64 binary
`@cline/cli-darwin-arm64` 3.0.74, sha256
75aa9293bf88517634c1bf832abae4c9e311f44929735e3858c0b5ba6667e38a; and the source tag
cli-v3.0.74 of github.com/cline/cline, Apache-2.0), read as text only, never run: chiefly
apps/cli/src/tui/components/input-bar.tsx, inline-tool-response.tsx, chat-message-list.tsx,
chat-entry.tsx, views/home-view.tsx, views/chat-view.tsx and views/onboarding. Only short UI
strings are transcribed; no code is copied.

idle-home-src.txt: the centred home view: a title, the input bar (`─` rules above and below, `❯`
and the act placeholder `What can I do for you?`) with leading spaces, and a status line.
idle-chat-src.txt: a user line, a settled reply (`*` gutter), the chat input bar with
`❯ Ask anything...`, and the status line.
idle-plan-src.txt: idle-chat-src.txt in plan mode (`❯ Plan something...`, `● Plan ○ Act`).
working-thinking-src.txt: idle-chat-src.txt with the turn's `dots` spinner frame and
`Thinking... (esc to cancel)` above the input bar.
working-stream-src.txt: idle-chat-src.txt with a streaming reply (a `dots` spinner frame in the
gutter); the thinking line is gone and the placeholder is still shown.
working-tool-src.txt: idle-chat-src.txt with a running tool (`dots` frame, `run_commands`).
waiting_for_approval-*-src.txt: the inline approval panel (`Cline needs permission`,
`Approve tool call?`, the tool and its parameters, `[y] Approve  [n] Deny`) for a shell command,
a file write and the plan-to-act switch (`switch_to_act_mode`); the input bar is replaced.
unknown-onboarding-src.txt: the first-run screen with no provider (`Welcome to Cline`,
`Connect a model provider to get started.`, provider rows).
unknown-question-src.txt: a question from the agent (`Cline is asking a question`, choices,
`Type a response...`); the input bar is replaced.
unknown-hubupdate-src.txt: the hub update dialog (`Cline Hub update required`, `Update Now`).
idle-statusbar-3row-src.txt: synthetic, built from cline cli-v3.0.74 apps/cli/src/tui status-bar.tsx 232-280 (archive sha256 93a9b203c217627713adc6ebe45f47644b5c9cde9b2fe85161d381329ca8a99f); U-R1B-COPILOT-WORKING
idle-statusbar-4row-src.txt: synthetic, built from cline cli-v3.0.74 apps/cli/src/tui status-bar.tsx 232-280 (archive sha256 93a9b203c217627713adc6ebe45f47644b5c9cde9b2fe85161d381329ca8a99f); U-R1B-COPILOT-WORKING

